1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,667
Orange...

2
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:01,816
or this leaf?

3
00:00:01,816 --> 00:00:02,632
Which one has

4
00:00:02,632 --> 00:00:03,453
more vitamin C?

5
00:00:04,511 --> 00:00:06,195
The answer...

6
00:00:06,195 --> 00:00:07,425
THIS LEAF!

7
00:00:07,425 --> 00:00:07,911
Its vitamin C is

8
00:00:07,911 --> 00:00:09,750
3x an orange's!

9
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,143
Meet katuk leaves.

10
00:00:11,143 --> 00:00:12,935
Often ignored...

11
00:00:12,935 --> 00:00:13,536
yet they're

12
00:00:13,536 --> 00:00:14,528
packed with nutrients!

13
00:00:14,528 --> 00:00:15,280
But there's one thing

14
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,086
you must know...

15
00:00:17,086 --> 00:00:17,998
First:

16
00:00:17,998 --> 00:00:19,548
a nursing mom's best friend!

17
00:00:19,548 --> 00:00:20,966
Since grandma's time,

18
00:00:20,966 --> 00:00:21,770
katuk has been believed

19
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:23,283
to boost breast milk...

20
00:00:23,283 --> 00:00:24,858
and some studies say

21
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:26,517
the results are promising!

22
00:00:26,517 --> 00:00:27,132
Second:

23
00:00:27,132 --> 00:00:29,987
its calcium beats...

24
00:00:29,987 --> 00:00:30,914
cow's milk!

25
00:00:30,914 --> 00:00:32,455
Yes, milk!

26
00:00:32,455 --> 00:00:33,465
Third:

27
00:00:33,465 --> 00:00:34,436
its carotenoids

28
00:00:34,436 --> 00:00:36,297
almost match carrots.

29
00:00:36,297 --> 00:00:37,092
Fourth:

30
00:00:37,092 --> 00:00:39,100
its iron equals spinach.

31
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,851
So if you're bored of spinach...

32
00:00:40,851 --> 00:00:41,876
here's your backup!

33
00:00:42,235 --> 00:00:43,756
here's what you must know.

34
00:00:43,756 --> 00:00:45,555
In 1990s Taiwan,

35
00:00:45,555 --> 00:00:46,372
a diet trend spread:

36
00:00:46,372 --> 00:00:47,688
raw katuk leaf juice.

37
00:00:47,688 --> 00:00:48,560
The result?

38
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,360
Many people got

39
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,370
serious lung problems!

40
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:52,817
So: cook it first,

41
00:00:52,817 --> 00:00:54,112
and don't overdo it.

42
00:00:54,112 --> 00:00:55,347
Cheap, easy to grow,

43
00:00:55,347 --> 00:00:56,475
full of benefits!

44
00:00:56,475 --> 00:00:57,567
Send this to a friend

45
00:00:57,567 --> 00:00:59,800
who still picks oranges!

